Colonel Dr Abdulla Nasser Al Mazrouei, Director of the Institutional Excellence and Leadership Department, and First Lieutenant Salim Salah AlGhoul, Head of Technical Coordination Branch, of 
@ADPoliceHQ
, discuss how AI use in policing strengthens Abu Dhabi’s security ecosystem.

Abu Dhabi Police won 2nd place in the 
@adaep
 Excellence Awards, in recognition of its role in reinforcing safety, strengthening community trust and enhancing emergency readiness, with Abu Dhabi ranked the world’s safest city.

Dr Noura Al Ghaithi, Undersecretary of 
@DoHSocial
, discusses key achievements to winning the Excellence Awards category and the Strategic Impact Initiative Award in the Collaborative Initiatives Award category of the Abu Dhabi Award for Excellence in Government Performance.

The Department of Health – Abu Dhabi came 1st in the 
@adaep
 Excellence Awards, and its Centers of Excellence project won Strategic Impact Initiative Award in the Collaborative Initiatives Awards, recognising how 
@DoHSocial
 instils a culture of excellence in the health sector.
